      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "RTX Remix’s built-in generative AI texture tools analyze low-resolution textures from classic games, generate physically accurate materials — including normal and roughness maps — and upscale the resolution by up to 4x. Many RTX Remix mods have been created incorporating generative AI.",
