      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Earlier this month, RTX Remix modder NightRaven published PBRFusion 3 — a new AI model that upscales textures and generates high-quality normal, roughness and height maps for physically-based materials.",
      "entity_name_normalized_hint": "PBRFusion 3",
