      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Half-Life 2 owners can download a free Half-Life 2 RTX demo from Steam , built with RTX Remix, starting March 18. The demo showcases Orbifold Studios’ work in Ravenholm and Nova Prospekt ahead of the full game’s release at a later date.",
